<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 92 0 R
/T (Explanation: Python limits call stack depth to ~1000 frames. Even with memoisation, the first call to ways_memo\(1000\) must recurse 1000 levels deep before hitting a cached value, exhausting the stack. Decision: Use the iterative solution for n > 500. Raising sys.setrecursionlimit is risky \(can segfault\). The iterative approach is O\(n\) time and O\(1\) space with no stack risk.)
/E (Explanation: Python limits call stack depth to ~1000 frames. Even with memoisation, the first call to ways_memo\(1000\) must recurse 1000 levels deep before hitting a cached value, exhausting the stack. Decision: Use the iterative solution for n > 500. Raising sys.setrecursionlimit is risky \(can segfault\). The iterative approach is O\(n\) time and O\(1\) space with no stack risk.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
