/Title (Explanation: Python limits call stack depth to ~1000 frames. Even with memoisation, the first call to ways_memo\(1000\) must recurse 1000 levels deep before hitting a cached value, exhausting the stack. Decision: Use the iterative solution for n > 500. Raising sys.setrecursionlimit is risky \(can segfault\). The iterative approach is O\(n\) time and O\(1\) space with no stack risk.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1319 0 R
/Prev 1370 0 R
>>
